Reactive data structures.
ReactiveMap
import { ReactiveMap, reactiveMap } from &#x27;sairin&#x27;;

const map = reactiveMap&lt;string, number&gt;();
// or with initial data
const map = new ReactiveMap([[&quot;a&quot;, 1], [&quot;b&quot;, 2]]);

Methods



Method
Description




